1. when some files change on local, and you need to git pull to sync other files
git stash save "save some files"
git pull
git stash pop

git stash list # list stash store
git stash show # show changes, git stash show stash@{1} for the second stash
git stash apply # apply but do not remove from stash list
git stash pop # apply and delete
git stash drop stash@{0} # drop the first stash item
git stash clear # clean all cache

2. new files won't be stash, you need git add them first, then stash
git add new-file
git stash save "new-file"
git checkout other-branch
git checkout ... # get back
git stash pop
git reset HEAD new-file # undo git add, use 'git reset HEAD' undo all git add files
